  - id: broken_scale
    displayName: Broken Scale
    flavorText: Micah indicts Judah's rulers, priests, and prophets for judging for
      reward, teaching for hire, and divining for money while leaning on the LORD's
      name.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Indicts Judah's civic and religious leadership - rulers who abhor justice,
      prophets who divine for money yet claim the LORD's protection, priests who
      teach for hire - declaring that because of their corruption Zion will be plowed
      as a field and Jerusalem will become heaps.
    deliveredByManagerId: micah
    managerId: judgment_against_leaders
