  - id: plowshares_forge
    displayName: Plowshare's Forge
    flavorText: Micah foresees nations streaming to the LORD's exalted house, beating
      swords into plowshares so that none shall learn war any more.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Envisions a future day when the LORD's house is exalted above all mountains
      and nations stream to it to learn His ways, converting weapons of war into
      farming tools and living in secure peace - a promise of universal peace under
      God's law, worded almost identically to Isaiah's temple-mountain oracle.
    deliveredByManagerId: micah
    managerId: mountain_of_the_lords_house
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
