  - id: ephratahs_seal
    displayName: Ephratah's Seal
    flavorText: Micah names little Bethlehem Ephratah as the origin of a coming ruler
      in Israel whose goings forth are from everlasting.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Names Bethlehem Ephratah, though little among Judah's clans, as the
      origin of a future ruler in Israel whose goings forth are 'from of old, from
      everlasting'; promises this ruler will stand and feed his flock in the strength
      of the LORD, becoming Israel's peace.
    deliveredByManagerId: micah
    managerId: bethlehem_ruler
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 3574.0736945012754
